message: >
  If you use this software or this digital edition, please cite it
  as below. That request is scholarly courtesy. It is not a
  copyright condition on James Clerk Maxwell's A Treatise on
  Electricity and Magnetism (1873), which is in the public domain.
title: "Maxwell EM Theory Processor"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mikinka
    given-names: Anthony
    email: antmikinka@gmail.com
abstract: >
  A Python pipeline that OCRs, classifies, and organizes James Clerk
  Maxwell's A Treatise on Electricity and Magnetism (1873). Maxwell's
  original text and mechanical extracts of it are public domain. The
  citation is for the software and original documentation only.
repository-code: "https://github.com/antmikinka/maxwell-em-processor"
